================================================================================
OUR MISSION & COMMUNITY COMMITMENT
================================================================================
This repository and web application were created to empower software engineers, 
especially those facing tech industry layoffs or preparing for high-stakes interviews, 
by providing 100% free, un-gated access to system design capacity calculation tools 
and architectural grading rubrics.

You are warmly encouraged to:
  • Fork this repository
  • Use it for personal study, interview preparation, and mock interviews
  • Contribute new system architecture patterns, formulas, and rubrics via Pull Requests
  • Share this project freely with peers and job seekers

RESTRICTION (NON-COMMERCIAL & NO PAYWALLING):
  • You may NOT use this software or its content for commercial purposes.
  • You may NOT sell, license, bundle into paid courses, or charge any fee to job seekers 
    or engineers for access to this tool, its derivatives, or its derived content.

